Consider the following C program:<pre><code> 
#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;
  int jumble(int x, int y) {
    x = 2 * x + y;
    return x;
  }
int main() {
  int x = 2, y = 5;
  y = jumble(y, x);
  x = jumble(y, x);
  printf("%d\n", x);
  return 0;
}</code></pre> 
The value printed by program is __________ .

